OL,3,GNEWSASupport for 'fantastic' Northern
OL,4,AOlympics idea
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Cheshire MP has given her backing to
OL,7,Fa #7m fund to explore how the Olympics
OL,8,Fcould be brought to northern England.
OL,10,FChancellor John Healey allocated the
OL,11,Fmoney for a full feasibility study on
OL,12,Fthe possibility for a bid for a
OL,13,F"Northern Games", in his first Budget
OL,14,Fon Wednesday.
OL,16,FIf successful, it could see the games
OL,17,Fheld in the North in the 2040s.
OL,19,FThe Labour MP for Warrington South,
OL,20,FSarah Hall, said she "absolutely"
OL,21,Fbacked the move to spend the #7m on the
OL,22,Fplan.
